"><h2>86%</h2></span></div><div data-rid="b371d7a8-2480-40d6-9179-f73890cd0078" class="r-ptehlm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>saw improved cycle</p><p>health after 30 days*</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="2e9f8372-5126-4fa3-b9ad-6cf69d181349" class="r-18ox31x"></div><div data-rid="88ad2bce-1b16-47ad-ad3e-b6c512473d44" class="r-1d89elg"><div data-rid="3851a95d-e3cd-476d-8cd9-f85cce09876b" class="r-p1dpl0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>80%</h2></span></div><div data-rid="065b3c82-5c3e-4eba-a788-0232a5aa51e0" class="r-27pw30 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>reported feeling less period</p><p>cramps and pain after 60 days*</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="9d7ada2a-28c8-4847-a9a4-e36b6843fa3f" class="r-8hepsg"></div></div><div data-rid="92e2e5c8-bbd1-42ff-8aad-38d5b28443b9" class="r-51qrlr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>* Based on an independent study of 105 women</p><p>aged 20 to 45 using the monthlies supplement.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="628d182a-7913-4bb0-9422-111914127e89" class="r-1ar523x"><div class="r-1rl4aw" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="ce94a225-a731-4bb6-9043-351f5054aebb" class="r-oyrcem"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="vertical" style="display:contents"><div class="r-1je5mho" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="7093f92b-2ca1-46ff-8640-8ab6255a7671" class="r-20l2fs"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="vertical" style="outline:none;display:contents" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="vertical"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-:Rcor2:-content-f3847e26-27eb-4e9d-94f2-de0ba1c568750" data-state="active" id="radix-:Rcor2:-trigger-f3847e26-27eb-4e9d-94f2-de0ba1c568750" style="display:contents" data-replo-tabs-trigger="true" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item=""><div data-rid="f3847e26-27eb-4e9d-94f2-de0ba1c56875" tabindex="0" class="r-1rionbz r-14gsvzj"><div data-rid="256cb12c-6e56-48c1-be61-34a6a63de060" class="r-1m8wlum alchemy-rte" style="